### Create Crunch
POST http://localhost:3000/api/crunch
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "strength": 10,
    "dexterity": 17,
    "constitution": 13,
    "intelligence": 14,
    "wisdom": 10,
    "charisma": 15,
    "class": "ROGUE",
    "race": "HUMAN",
    "level": 1
}

### Get Crunches
GET http://localhost:3000/api/crunch
Content-Type: application/json

### Get Crunch
GET http://localhost:3000/api/crunch/6a03c32d645e63844af89c48
Content-Type: application/json

### Generate
POST http://localhost:3000/api/fluff/6a046592a61b67075e235833
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "model": "gemini-flash-lite-latest",
    "themeKeywords": [
        "Archaeotech",
        "Dragon gods",
        "Lost civilization"
    ]
}

### Get Fluff by crunchId
GET http://localhost:3000/api/fluff?crunchId=6a046592a61b67075e235833
Content-Type: application/json

### Get Fluff (all)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/fluff
Content-Type: application/json